# URLs the weekly link check must not follow (.github/workflows/links.yml).
# One regular expression per line.

# The local preview server, from the mkdocs instructions in README.md.
^http://127\.0\.0\.1

# Ontology namespace URIs. These are identifiers, not addresses: the vocabulary
# this project mints is based under a domain it controls so that the terms are
# attributed correctly, but nothing is served at those paths and nothing is meant
# to be. A 404 there is the expected answer, not a broken link.
^https://jefflevesque\.com/ontology/
